From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Noxwell <beebono@yahoo.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 08:30:07 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 155/225] mailbox: sprd: add ums512 (R1) binding; fixes
 disabled inbox IRQ

ums512's mailbox DT declared sprd,ums9230-mailbox (R2), but the hardware
uses the R1 inbox FIFO layout (delivery bits GENMASK(23,16), per the
vendor driver). Under R2 the inbox ISR reads GENMASK(15,0), sees no
delivery on a real interrupt, treats it as spurious (IRQ_NONE), and the
line gets auto-disabled at boot ("irq N: nobody cared", sprd_mbox_inbox_isr).

Add an R1 ums512_mbox_info (supp_id 6) + sprd,ums512-mailbox compatible
and point the DT at it. Outbox is version-independent so DSP/SIPC were
unaffected; only the inbox tx-completion path was broken.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/sprd/ums512.dtsi | 2 +-
 drivers/mailbox/sprd-mailbox.c       | 6 ++++++
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/sprd/ums512.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/sprd/ums512.dtsi
index a2bd9249c..e2b8bfb3d 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/sprd/ums512.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/sprd/ums512.dtsi
@@ -1099,7 +1099,7 @@ audcpahb_gate: clock-controller@0 {
 		};
 
 		mailbox: mailbox@320a0000 {
-			compatible = "sprd,ums9230-mailbox";
+			compatible = "sprd,ums512-mailbox";
 			reg = <0x0 0x320a0000 0x0 0x8000>,
 			      <0x0 0x320a8000 0x0 0x8000>;
 			clocks = <&aonapb_gate CLK_MBOX_EB>;
diff --git a/drivers/mailbox/sprd-mailbox.c b/drivers/mailbox/sprd-mailbox.c
index 565502904..83f9dfd95 100644
--- a/drivers/mailbox/sprd-mailbox.c
+++ b/drivers/mailbox/sprd-mailbox.c
@@ -450,10 +450,16 @@ static const struct sprd_mbox_info ums9230_mbox_info = {
 	.supp_id = 6,
 };
 
+static const struct sprd_mbox_info ums512_mbox_info = {
+    .version = SPRD_MBOX_R1,
+    .supp_id = 6,
+};
+
 static const struct of_device_id sprd_mbox_of_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "sprd,sc9860-mailbox", .data = &sc9860_mbox_info },
 	{ .compatible = "sprd,sc9863a-mailbox", .data = &sc9863a_mbox_info },
 	{ .compatible = "sprd,ums9230-mailbox", .data = &ums9230_mbox_info },
+	{ .compatible = "sprd,ums512-mailbox", .data = &ums512_mbox_info },
 	{ },
 };
 MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(of, sprd_mbox_of_match);
